cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use camt053-mcp in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "camt053-mcp: Model Context Protocol server for ISO 20022 bank statements"
abstract: >-
  A Model Context Protocol server exposing the camt053 library to AI agents:
  twenty-four tools for parsing, validating, filtering and reversing ISO 20022
  camt.053 and camt.052 bank statements, migrating MT940 and MT942, checking
  CBPR+ readiness, citing payments rulebooks and exporting accounting journals.
authors:
